// SkSL port of the upstream flat-shape material: analytic Perlin slope, flow warp,
// bevel normal, three-bank studio, sharp glint and two-tap chromatic dispersion.
// Adaptations: FFrames' cached positive-inside glyph SDF/normal and exact glyph
// coverage replace upstream shape routing; glyph-height coordinates replace its
// square shape viewport; the caption clock controls flow and release. Color uses
// linear sRGB (rather than the upstream default P3) before display encoding.

